jectiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (injective-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"40e9baae4307d573\" href=\"?note=40e9baae4307d573\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-injective-function.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-injective-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SurjectiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SurjectiveFunction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (surjective-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd4053586826de5e\" href=\"?note=fd4053586826de5e\" title=\"58-df-zfc-surjective-function\">58-df-zfc-surjective-function</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bijection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Bijection}_S(f,A,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{InjectiveFunction}_S(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{SurjectiveFunction}_S(f,A,B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}bijection} \\vdash \\mathrm{Bijection}_S(f,A,B) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{InjectiveFunction}_S(f,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{SurjectiveFunction}_S(f,A,B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-card6-bijection</code> is an alias of this injective-and-surjective predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-injective-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"40e9baae4307d573","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · de